# Simple Calculator in C

## Description
This is a simple calculator program written in C. It performs basic arithmetic operations such as addition, subtraction, multiplication, and division using a menu-driven interface.

## Features
- Addition
- Subtraction
- Multiplication
- Division
- Menu-driven program
- Handles division by zero

## Technologies Used
- C Programming Language
- GCC Compiler

## Project Structure
```
Calculator/
├── calculator.c
└── README.md
```

## ▶️ How to Compile

```bash
gcc calculator.c -o calculator
```

## ▶️ How to Run

### Windows
```bash
calculator.exe
```

### Linux/macOS
```bash
./calculator
```

